Z||000000||want a fiero||12-14-2001||08:28 PM|||| What car should i get, i turn 16 in 2 weeks.<BR>  1. 86-88 fiero gt<BR>  2.87-92 camaro z28<BR>  3.87-92 pontiac firebird gta<BR>  4.90-92 nissan 300zx NA<BR>  5.88-92 toyota supra<BR>  6.88-93 mustang lx/gt 5.0<BR>i hade a 88 fiero 4cly and it was alot of fun to drive but took alot of work to keep up and i have a tight budget so i can not put alot of money in it just to keep it running||||reg||5
