Z||000013||Old Lar||12-15-2001||09:42 AM||||Lots of Fieros around. Fiero Factory would have used ones on site ready to roll as does Twin Lakes Fiero.  Both vendors should have very reliable used Fieros for $5K.  Both have good reputations for the work they do on Fieros.  You may not find a good Fiero locally.  Just ask the right questions as to the car's history and run a carfax report on anyone you find.||||reg||1
